<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1559-zh-10ebba6f" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>《聲無哀樂論。今譯</title><editor role="translator">Liu Zaisheng 劉再生</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>《聲無哀樂論。今譯</title>音樂藝術 I, 2000，pp. 7-13,2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1559"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-05-28T00:53:52.123+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1559-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:56:54.645+09:00">“秦客”间“东野主人”：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:14.331+09:00">以前常说</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:18.321+09:00">“治世之音安以乐．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:22.667+09:00">亡国之音哀以思”，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:36.801+09:00">国家的安定或混乱在于政治．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:48.115+09:00">音乐只是反映了这种现象而已，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:56.943+09:00">所以无论悲哀忧虑</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:58:18.283+09:00">或安详欢乐的感情都会表现于金石管弦之中 </seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:58:30.325+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:59:22.663+09:00">再如孔子听《韶》乐。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:59:29.001+09:00">理解了虞舜的德行；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:59:40.087+09:00">季札观乐，</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>